  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MIDAS: Mitigating Impacts of Drought on Agriculture livelihoods and food Security</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protect the agriculture livelihoods of vulnerable marginal farming households from the adverse impacts of the ongoing drought, COVID-19 and other recent shocks and worsening of existing food crisis in Afghanistan by providing time-critical and season-sensitive emergency assistance in the form of quality agriculture inputs, related technical training and awareness building on COVID-19 safety measures to adopt during farm level practices and market participation.</narrative>
  </description>
